  "nl_text": "The rschema_0496 database is designed to manage information about users, products, transactions, and product images. The User table stores details about each user, including their age, avatar URL, email, gender, location, nickname, personal introduction, phone number, and a unique user ID, which serves as the primary key. The Product table contains information about the products being sold, such as the condition description, detailed description, original and selling prices, product category, status, title, and the seller's ID, which references the User table and is not nullable. The Transaction table tracks transactions between buyers and sellers, including the buyer's ID, product ID, transaction amount, evaluation, location, method, status, and time, with a composite primary key consisting of the buyer's ID, product ID, and transaction time, and foreign keys referencing the User and Product tables. The Product_image table stores images associated with products, with a unique image ID as the primary key, an image URL, and a product ID that references the Product table and is not nullable.",
  "gold_question": "This is a C2C (Consumer-to-Consumer) second-hand goods trading platform, aimed at providing users with a safe and convenient environment for trading used items. For user account management, the system supports quick registration and login through phone numbers and email, provides real-name authentication functionality requiring users to upload ID card photos (front and back) and complete facial recognition to ensure transaction security, supports personal information maintenance including avatar, nickname, gender, age, location, personal introduction and other basic information, and provides account security settings including phone binding and email binding. For product management, the system supports users in publishing second-hand product information, including product title, detailed description, condition description, original price, selling price, etc., provides product content editing functionality with support for uploading up to 9 actual product photos, supports setting product categories, transaction location, price negotiation range, validity period, etc., and manages real-time product status including on sale, sold, removed, pending review, etc. For transaction management, the system records buyer user information and product information, transaction status, transaction time, transaction amount, transaction location, transaction method, and transaction evaluation.",
  "input_json": "/data/RSchema_ExpResults4/Experiment2/schema2text_llama31/0496.json",
  "ddl": "-- Schema for database: rschema_0496\nCREATE TABLE `user` (\n  `user_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `age` int(11) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `avatar_url` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `email` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `gender` varchar(10) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `location` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `nickname` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `personal_introduction` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `phone_number` varchar(15) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`user_id`)\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `product` (\n  `product_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `condition_description` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `detailed_description` text DEFAULT NULL,\n  `original_price` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  `selling_price` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  `category` varchar(100) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `status` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `title` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `seller_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`product_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `product_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`seller_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `transaction` (\n  `buyer_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `product_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `transaction_time` datetime NOT NULL,\n  `transaction_amount` decimal(10,2) NOT NULL,\n  `evaluation` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `location` varchar(255) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `method` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  `status` varchar(50) DEFAULT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`buyer_id`, `product_id`, `transaction_time`),\n  CONSTRAINT `transaction_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`buyer_id`) REFERENCES `user` (`user_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE,\n  CONSTRAINT `transaction_ibfk_2` FOREIGN KEY (`product_id`) REFERENCES `product` (`product_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;\n\nCREATE TABLE `product_image` (\n  `image_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  `image_url` varchar(255) NOT NULL,\n  `product_id` int(11) NOT NULL,\n  PRIMARY KEY (`image_id`),\n  CONSTRAINT `product_image_ibfk_1` FOREIGN KEY (`product_id`) REFERENCES `product` (`product_id`) ON DELETE CASCADE ON UPDATE CASCADE\n) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb3;",
